TI  - Effects of temperature and relative humidity on germination, vegetative growth, sporulation, and pathogenicity of native Beauveria bassiana isolates and formulations against adult desert locust (Schistocerca gregaria Forskål)
AU  - Mwikali, Pamela C
AU  - Mwamburi, Lizzy A
AU  - Musinguzi, Simon Peter
