TI  - Evaluating mortality and repellency potentials of Beauveria bassiana (Hypocreales: Cordycipitaceae) and Kosakonia radicincitans (Enterobacterialels: Enterobacteriaceae) on banana mealybug Pseudococcus elisae (Hemiptera: Pseudococcidae)
AU  - Becke, Henry
