TI  - Research advances in Ecuador on use of entomopathogenic fungi for control of the cattle tick, &lt;i&gt;Rhipicephalus microplus&lt;/i&gt;: the case of &lt;i&gt;Beauveria bassiana&lt;/i&gt; sensu lato strain INIAP L3B3
