TI  - The bHLHzip-type transcription factor, &lt;i&gt;MaHpa3&lt;/i&gt;, regulates conidial rodlet formation and cell surface hydrophobicity in the insect fungal pathogen &lt;i&gt;Metarhizium acridum&lt;/i&gt;
