TI  - Field life tables and key mortality factors of Pieris brassicae (Linnaeus) infesting cauliflower (Brassica oleracea var. botrytis)
AU  - SHIKHA, DEEP
AU  - CHANDI, RAVINDER SINGH
AU  - KATARIA, SANJEEV KUMAR
