TI  - Applicability of entomopathogenic fungi and essential oils against the fall armyworm Spodoptera frugiperda  (Lepidoptera: Noctuidae)
AU  - Fakeer, Mahmoud
AU  - Hamam, Gamal
AU  - Joo, Jin
