TI  - Ecological bottlenecks and future pathways for &lt;i&gt;Zygogramma bicolorata&lt;/i&gt; as a biocontrol agent of &lt;i&gt;Parthenium hysterophorus&lt;/i&gt; in North India
AU  - Gupta, Rakesh Kumar
