TI  - A single amino acid polymorphism in natural Metchnikowin alleles of Drosophila results in systemic immunity and life history tradeoffs
AU  - Perlmutter, Jessamyn I
AU  - Chapman, Joanne R
AU  - Wilkinson, Mason C
AU  - Nevarez-Saenz, Isaac
AU  - Unckless, Robert L
