TI  - Proteomic and Phosphoryproteomic Investigations Reveal that Autophagy-Related Protein 1, a Protein Kinase for Autophagy Initiation, Synchronously Deploys Phosphoregulation on the Ubiquitin-Like Conjugation System in the Mycopathogen Beauveria bassiana
