TI  - Essential Roles of Two FRQ Proteins (Frq1 and Frq2) in Beauveria bassiana's Virulence, Infection Cycle, and Calcofluor-Specific Signaling
AU  - Tong, Sen-Miao
AU  - Gao, Ben-Jie
AU  - Peng, Han
AU  - Feng, Ming-Guang
IS  - 6
VL  - 87
