AB  - The complete mitochondrial genome of the Nematophagous fungus <i>Esteya vermicola</i> CBS 115803 was determined using the PacBio RS II sequencing technology. The circular molecule is 47,282bp in length with a GC content of 24.85%. Annotated genes including 14 conserved protein-coding genes, the large and the small rRNA subunit (rnl and rns) and 27 tRNAs. The phylogenetic analysis showed that <i>E. vermicola</i> had close genetic relationship with the genus <i>Sporothrix</i>.
