TI  - Entomopathogenic fungi-based mechanisms for improved Fe nutrition in sorghum plants grown on calcareous substrates
AU  - Raya-Díaz, Silvia
AU  - Sánchez-Rodríguez, Antonio Rafael
AU  - Segura-Fernández, José Manuel
AU  - Del Campillo, María Del Carmen
AU  - Quesada-Moraga, Enrique
IS  - 10
