TI  - The CLIP-domain serine protease CLIPC9 regulates melanization downstream of SPCLIP1, CLIPA8, and CLIPA28 in the malaria vector Anopheles gambiae
AU  - Sousa, Gregory L
AU  - Bishnoi, Ritika
AU  - Baxter, Richard H G
AU  - Povelones, Michael
