TI  - Harnessing the potential of cross-protection stressor interactions for conservation: a review
AU  - Rodgers, Essie M
AU  - Gomez Isaza, Daniel F
IS  - 1
VL  - 9
DA  - 2021///
PY  - 2021
T2  - Conservation physiology
J2  - Conserv Physiol
SN  - 2051-1434
