TI  - Hydrophobins are required for conidial hydrophobicity and plant root colonization in the fungal biocontrol agent Clonostachys rosea
AU  - Dubey, Mukesh K
AU  - Jensen, Dan Funck
AU  - Karlsson, Magnus
VL  - 14
DA  - 2014/01//
